on, or use the computer stations and seating for focused work.","short_summary":"A collaborative room where Cal Lutheran writers can workshop projects at any stage or settle in for independent study.","evidence_claim":"The university identifies the Writing Center as a collaborative space in Pearson Library 132 offering peer consultations, workshops, computer stations, comfortable chairs, and use as a study space.","source_url":"https://www.callutheran.edu/students/writing-center/","source_title":"Overview | The Writing Center at Cal Lutheran","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Located in Pearson Library 132. The posted regular hours are Monday–Friday, noon–5 p.m., with additional hours shown in the appointment schedule.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"student-union","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Student Union","title":"Reset Between Classes Without Leaving Campus","subtitle":"A student-centered gathering place at 3391 Mountclef Boulevard","notes":"Use the workstations for a quick task, ask the Info Desk about equipment, or meet classmates in a first-come, first-served room.","short_summary":"The campus hub combines places to relax and socialize with workstations, games, meeting rooms, charging, and printing.","evidence_claim":"Cal Lutheran describes the Student Union as a place to play, socialize, relax, spend time between classes, use workstations, attend events, and access student services.","source_url":"https://www.callutheran.edu/student-life/student-union","source_title":"Student Union | Cal Lutheran","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Located at 3391 Mountclef Blvd. Building access during open hours requires a student ID card; consult the Union's current hours page bef