lack Excellence Lounge","title":"Connect in a Space Shaped by Student Advocacy","subtitle":"Supportive community room inside the Student Union","notes":"Check the CCEI program calendar or email the center before visiting for a scheduled gathering, club meeting, or community program.","short_summary":"Black student advocacy helped establish this named lounge for connection, belonging, and community-building.","evidence_claim":"Cal Lutheran describes the Alexander Twilight Legacy of Black Excellence Lounge as an open, supportive community space serving Cal Lutheran's Black student community and credits Black Student Union and Sisters' Circle advocacy for its creation.","source_url":"https://www.callutheran.edu/students/cultural-engagement/ccei-spaces/alexandertwilight.html","source_title":"The Alexander Twilight Legacy of Black Excellence | Cal Lutheran","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Located in the Student Union. Program schedules are maintained by CCEI; contact the center for current room access and event information.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"ccei-patio","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"CCEI Patio","title":"Move a Club Conversation Into the Open Air","subtitle":"Student-created patio outside the Student Union’s upper level","notes":"Use the patio when no program is scheduled, or email CCEI ahead of time to request a reservation or accessibility support.","short_summary":"An outdoor gathering area created with student-government involvement gives culture and justice clubs room to meet and host programs.","evidence_claim":"Cal Lutheran states that the CCEI Patio was created with ASCLUG and student-life partners, is located outside the Student Union's upper level, and can be reserved by culture and justice clubs.","source_url":"https://www.callutheran.edu/students/cultural-engagement/ccei-spaces/cceipatio.html","source_title":"CCEI Patio | Cal Lutheran","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Located outside the upper level of the Student Union near Mt. Clef Residence Hall. Email CCEI for reservations and accessibility requests.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":[]}],"warnings":[]}
